*** Keywords ***
CB007449_SyVe_Freq_Domain_Beam_Long_PUCCH
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test is to verify that Long PUCCH resources are beamformed.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : configuration id of NR cell to perform throughput transmission e.g.: 1
    ...  :param dict throughput: (Mandatory) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                        it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                        defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                        Example:
    ...                                           {
    ...                                             '827736065':
    ...                                                   {
    ...                                                      'throughput':
    ...                                                          {
    ...                                                              'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                              'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                          },
    ...                                                      'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                  },
    ...                                         }
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dictionary with pairs of UE Serial Number - desired network mode e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only", "SN321": "NR_only}
    ...                                             possible network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE (NR_LTE mode CAN NOT be used with any of the other
    ...                                             two in case of more than one UE); defaults to ${None} (current modes set on UEs will be used)
    ...  :param str measurement_interval: (Optional) : measurement interval defined in minutes, related to single measurement frame duration
    ...                                                set in SCF configuration as 'miNrCellUtilization' parameter. One of following values possible to set:
    ...                                                5min, 15min, 30min, or 60min, defaults to 5min.
    ...  :param int number_of_ues: (Optional) : Number of UEs used during L3call, defaults to 1.

    [Arguments]    ${cell_id}
    ...            ${throughput}
    ...            ${protocol}=udp
    ...            ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...            ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...            ${measurement_interval}=5min
    ...            ${number_of_ues}=1

    [Timeout]      24 hours
    &{required_scf_config_params}=                          Create Dictionary
    ...                                                     miNrDlSignalQuality=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     miNrRRCC=${measurement_interval}

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Verify SCF Parameters Responsible For Counters Collection
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     expected_parameters_values_dict=${required_scf_config_params}
    ...                                                     parameters_distname=MRBTS-{}/NRBTS-{}/NRPMRNL-1

    ${sw_version}                                           admin_info_model.get_sw_version
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    bip_logs.check_mcshark_plugin                           sw_version=${sw_version}

    ${counter_ids}                                          Create List
    ...                                                     M55308C17002    M55308C18002
    ...                                                     M55308C00047    M55308C00048    M55308C00049    M55308C00050

    ${cell_dist_names}                                      admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=nr
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}

    ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}                      measurements_timer.convert_time_parameter_from_minutes_format_to_int
    ...                                                     time_parameter=${measurement_interval}
    ${measurement_interval_in_seconds}                      Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}*60

    ${call_duration}=                                       Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${measurement_interval_in_seconds}*2+30

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting L3 call with uplink and downlink transmission...
    Execute L3 Call In Background                           called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     direction=UL_DL
    ...                                                     duration=${call_duration}s
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughput}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                                     prepare_cells_to_call=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting up to ${measurement_interval} for a new clear counters frame start...
    ${new_counters_start_time}                              Wait For New Counters Data Frame Generation
    ...                                                     data_frame_interval=${measurement_interval}
    Robot Log Result                                        New clear counters frame starts at ${new_counters_start_time}

    Start collecting BIP logs                               alias=L1L2_BIP_Logs

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting 60seconds for logs collection...
    Sleep                                                   60s

    ${bip_path}                                             Stop collecting BIP logs
    ...                                                     alias=L1L2_BIP_Logs
    ...                                                     bip_log_name=tcpdump.pcap
    ...                                                     dir_path=${logs_path}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Collecting counters '${counter_ids}' for NRCELL-${cell_id}.
    ${counters_max_num_of_scheduled_ues}                    Wait for End of Current Counters Frame and Collect Counters
    ...                                                     data_frame_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     counter_ids=${counter_ids}
    ...                                                     component_name=NRCELL-${cell_id}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Stopping L3 call transmission...
    Stop L3 Call In Background and Disallow Alarms          called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     ignore_error=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifing BIP Log PCAP file.
    Verify BIP PCAP Log                                     bip_path=${bip_path}
    ...                                                     number_of_ues=${number_of_ues}
    ...                                                     verify_numOfSymbols=${True}
    ...                                                     verify_patternIds=${True}
    ...                                                     verify_UCIBits=${True}
    ...                                                     verify_srBitDetection=${True}
    Robot Log Result                                        Verification of BIP Log messages completed successfully.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifing max num of scheduled UEs for NRCELL-${cell_id}.
    Verify max num of scheduled UEs                         counters_results=${counters_max_num_of_scheduled_ues}
    ...                                                     expected_number_of_ues=${number_of_ues}
    Robot Log Result                                        Verification completed successfully. Counters '${counter_ids}' are equal `number_of_ues`.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifing PDSCH HARQ Allocations for Format1 and Format3
    Verify PDSCH HARQ Allocations for F1 and F3             counters_results=${counters_max_num_of_scheduled_ues}
    ...                                                     number_of_ues=${number_of_ues}
    Robot Log Result                                        Verification of PDSCH HARQ Allocations for F1 and F3 counters completed successfully.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    [Teardown]    Run keywords                              Run keyword and ignore error
    ...                                                     Stop collecting BIP logs
    ...                                                     alias=L1L2_BIP_Logs
    ...                                                     dir_path=${logs_path}
    ...           AND                                       Stop L3 Call In Background and Disallow Alarms
    ...                                                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     ignore_error=${True}


Verify BIP PCAP Log
    [Arguments]  ${bip_path}
    ...          ${number_of_ues}
    ...          ${verify_numOfSymbols}=${True}
    ...          ${verify_patternIds}=${True}
    ...          ${verify_UCIBits}=${True}
    ...          ${verify_srBitDetection}=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Converting BIP pcap to json file...
    ${json_path}                                            bip_logs.convert_bip_log_file_to_json
    ...                                                     bip_path=${bip_path}
    ...                                                     filter=uldata_pucchreceivereq || uldata_pucchreceiverespps
    ...                                                     alternative_filter=uldata_pucchreceivereql1sw || uldata_pucchreceiveresppsl1sw
    Robot Log Result                                        Json file with converted Bip data has been created: ${json_path}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Getting BIP log data from json file...
    bip_logs.load_bip_logs_data_from_json                   json_path=${json_path}

    Run keyword if                                          ${verify_numOfSymbols}
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...  Robot Log Operation                                Validating of numOfSymbols...
    ...  AND
    ...  bip_logs.validate_numOfSymbols_CB007449
    ...  AND
    ...  Robot Log Result                                   Validation numOfSymbols completed successfully!

    Run keyword if                                          ${verify_patternIds}
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...  Robot Log Operation                                Validating of patternIds...
    ...  AND
    ...  bip_logs.validate_pattern_ids_CB007449
    ...  AND
    ...  Robot Log Result                                   Validation patternIds completed successfully!

    Run keyword if                                          ${verify_UCIBits}
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...  Robot Log Operation                                Validating of UCIBits...
    ...  AND
    ...  bip_logs.validate_uci_bits_CB007449
    ...  AND
    ...  Robot Log Result                                   Validation UCIBits completed successfully!

    Run keyword if                                          ${verify_srBitDetection}
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...  Robot Log Operation                                Validating of srBitDetection...
    ...  AND
    ...  bip_logs.validate_srbit_detection_CB007449         number_of_ues=${number_of_ues}
    ...  AND
    ...  Robot Log Result                                   Validation srBitDetection completed successfully!
